    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.07",
    "summary": "A unit needs specific permission to use Shock Disembark. It must be aboard a TRANSPORT already on the battlefield and must have boarded before the current phase. Follow the general setup procedure and place every model entirely within 3 inches of that TRANSPORT. The unit cannot declare charges for the rest of the turn.",
